{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warden of the Crypt</strong> is a tower defense game with minimalist gameplay and fast-paced action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forces of darkness emerge relentlessly, and there is nowhere to run. You are the last wizard capable of protecting the crypt, casting spells and using ultimate powers to withstand waves of enemies. Survive as long as you can before the inevitable happens. Collect <strong>ancient books</strong> to increase your power, along with <strong>health and attack speed potions</strong> to strengthen your resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supports mouse, keyboard and touchscreen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557110/extras/489c8e8b979b0fe2a18415e4515fa5d3.avif?t=1742856151\" width=548 height=536 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557110?t=1742856151","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557110/c5df74f7799d05fddf0289a429c2a13d790fe021/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742856151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557110/962d9516445a41eb60a4bfcb4f8a8976af2f7f80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742856151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557110/962d9516445a41eb60a4bfcb4f8a8976af2f7f80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742856151","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warden of the Crypt</strong> is a tower defense game with minimalist gameplay and fast-paced action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forces of darkness emerge relentlessly, and there is nowhere to run. You are the last wi